  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advancing STEM Education to equip students with relevant skills to navigate the complexities of modern society and contribute meaningfully to their communities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The imperative to elevate Science, Technology, Engineering, and Mathematics (STEM) within the educational journey of students worldwide is gaining significant momentum. Regardless of their future career paths, it is essential for young individuals to possess a solid understanding of science and technology to navigate the complexities of modern society and contribute meaningfully to their communities. Such an understanding requires strong foundations, including in literacy which thousands of children and youth, particularly boys do not possess in the region. This workplan aims to strengthen STEM institutions and programmes to equip learners with more relevant skills, including in innovation, creativity to contribute to and keep pace with rapidly technological evolving world.</narrative>
  </description>
